
San öwren: ['plus:'] manysy: ['+'].
San gelende: ['+'] et: { :x
	>> rate := 1.
	>> currency := x ölçeg-birligi.
	(currency = ['euros']) dogry: {
		rate := 2.
	}. <- (özi plus: (x × rate)).
}.
>> dollars := 3.
>> euros := 2.
dollars birlik: ['dollars'].
euros birlik: ['euros'].
>> money := dollars + euros.
Çykyş ýaz: money, täze-setir.
